    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Million Clicker is a short game where you click a button. Except by &quot;short&quot; I mean long, and by &quot;game&quot; I mean humorless experience. Join millions on their quest to get to the millionth click. If millions play the 'game,' that is.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consistency is better than speed. If you click just once a minute, you can beat this game in one year, 10 months, and 25 days! That's just less than two years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking for that long means you'll want the most out of each press. Follow this guide to help you find your rhythm:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your two forefingers on your left mouse button, and erratically vibrate your forearm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will give your clicks a needed boost, if not tiring your arm faster.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Million Clicker is a short game where you click a button. Except by &quot;short&quot; I mean long, and by &quot;game&quot; I mean humorless experience. Join millions on their quest to get to the millionth click. If millions play the 'game,' that is.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consistency is better than speed. If you click just once a minute, you can beat this game in one year, 10 months, and 25 days! That's just less than two years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking for that long means you'll want the most out of each press. Follow this guide to help you find your rhythm:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your two forefingers on your left mouse button, and erratically vibrate your forearm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will give your clicks a needed boost, if not tiring your arm faster.</p>",
    "short_description": "A humorless clicker-toy, where you click a million times.",
